            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2025-i:reading-d",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 2,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2025-i:reading-d:2",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao"
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:tap#e-d1116668b714c3eb",
          "text": "The new study suggests boiling tap water could be a tool to limit intake.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
